      "Exclusion of metabolic and inflammatory causes"
    ],
    "imaging": [
      "MRI brain and spinal cord may show mild corticospinal tract atrophy",
      "No significant white matter lesions"
    ],
    "genetic": [
      "ALDH18A1 (causative, loss-of-function)",
      "Autosomal dominant inheritance"
    ],
    "other": [
      "Electromyography (EMG) and nerve conduction studies typically normal or show mild abnormalities"
    ]
